			"notes": "**MeetCraft now stays out of Meet until you turn it on.** Open the call in Meet and click **Turn on** in the \"⛏ MeetCraft\" badge at the bottom left; the page reloads with MeetCraft on. Until then the extension doesn't touch your mic, camera or the call. It starts off again for every new meeting.\n\n**Updating from 0.1.0**\n1. Replace `meetcraft-0.1.0.jar` in your `mods/` folder with `meetcraft-0.1.1.jar`. Don't keep both.\n2. Open `meetcraft-0.1.1.xpi` in Firefox or Zen and click *Add*. It updates the extension in place.\n\n**New install:** a Fabric 26.3 instance with the jar in `mods/`, and the `.xpi` in Firefox or a Firefox-based browser (128+). See the [README](https://github.com/hunortakacs/meetcraft#readme), which now also explains how the Meet mic works."
		},
